\begin{frame}{Is this racializing discourse?}
  Discourse around Creoles and Cajuns resembles what has been examined for African-Americans
  \begin{enumerate}
    \item Cajuns are White but that does not need to be said
    \item Creoles are explicitly Black
    \item Creole culture, even when the same, is different
    \item Creoles do not say much about Cajuns but Cajuns say much about Creoles
  \end{enumerate}
\end{frame}